WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.190
The school newsletter. Twelve things, six of them yours.

2
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:10.680
Forward it to your Shoebox address. Every date about your family becomes its own post.

3
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:16.570
They come back before the day. It reads on your phone, with Apple Intelligence.

4
00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.000
Shoebox.
